OL,3,GNEWSAFears 210 homes at coast path
OL,4,A'just the beginning'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents and opponents fear plans to
OL,7,Fbuild 210 homes between two towns are
OL,8,F"just the beginning" with the potential
OL,9,Ffor more to be built in the area.
OL,11,FDevelopers Taylor Wimpey are proposing
OL,12,Fto build the development between Redcar
OL,13,Fand Marske, just south of the coast
OL,14,Fpath, using a slice of the open land.
OL,16,FPippa Watson, who has worked in Marske
OL,17,Ffor 16 years, said if planning
OL,18,Fpermission was approved it "will spoil
OL,19,Fone of the nicest areas" around the
OL,20,Ftown.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
