OL,3,GNEWSAFears 210 homes at coast path
OL,4,A'just the beginning'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Taylor Wimpey spokesperson said they
OL,7,Funderstand local concerns but are
OL,8,F"confident" their proposal will deliver
OL,9,Fa sustainable new community.
